<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="hi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>लोधा समाज इंदौर — share card</title>
  <!--
    The square card for WhatsApp status and forwards. Like the reel's end card
    this is a page, not something drawn by hand, so it carries the site's own
    logo, colours and fonts - what people see before they tap is what they find
    after.

    It is a template, NOT a page of the site: tools/make_share_assets.py copies
    it to .share-card.html at the root for one screenshot and removes it again.
    A dot-path is skipped by Pages and by both of the repo's path guards. See
    the same note in tools/reel-intro-endcard.html.in.

    Rendered at 540x540 x2 -> 1080x1080.
  -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/css/site.css">
  <style>
    html, body { height: 100%; }
    body {
      margin: 0; display: grid; place-items: center; text-align: center;
      background:
        radial-gradient(120% 75% at 50% 0%, rgba(232, 163, 61, 0.24), transparent 64%),
        var(--ind-d);
      color: #fff;
    }
    .card { padding: 0 40px; }
    .card > img { width: 104px; height: auto; margin-bottom: 14px; }
    h1 { margin: 0; font-family: var(--head); font-weight: 400;
         font-size: 2.15rem; line-height: 1.2; color: #fff; }
    .tag { margin: 8px 0 18px; color: var(--mar); font-size: 0.98rem; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
    .what { margin: 0 auto 20px; max-width: 24em; color: #e6dff5;
            font-size: 1.02rem; line-height: 1.55; }
    .qr { display: inline-block; padding: 9px; background: #fff; border-radius: 8px; }
    .qr img { display: block; width: 128px; height: 128px; image-rendering: pixelated; }
    .url { margin: 16px 0 0; font-family: var(--body); font-weight: 700;
           font-size: 1.4rem; color: #fff; }
    .jai { margin: 16px 0 0; font-family: var(--head); font-size: 1.05rem; color: var(--gold); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="card">
    <img src="/assets/img/logo.png" alt="">
    <h1>लोधा समाज इंदौर</h1>
    <p class="tag">सेवा · शिक्षा · स्वास्थ्य</p>
    <p class="what">आयोजनों की तिथियाँ, दानदाताओं की वर्षवार सूचियाँ,
       शिक्षा और स्वास्थ्य की जानकारी, और समाज के चित्र — सब एक जगह।</p>
    <span class="qr"><img src="/assets/img/share/qr-lodhasamaj.png" alt=""></span>
    <p class="url">lodhasamaj.org</p>
    <p class="jai">॥ जय माता दी ॥</p>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
